oth movement<br></i></li><li> Unique 1:1 format<br></li><li> Catchy and original soundtrack<br></li><li> Cartoony and unique graphics<br></li><li> Different armors with different stats<br></li><li> Interactive and fair boss fights<br></li><li> Hidden passages<br></li><li> Hidden Easter Eggs and rooms<br></li><li> Weapons<br></li><li> Double Jumping<br></li><li> ...</li></ul>",
